# Waqti Runtime — Final RMSNorm + LM Head + First Logits

## Scope complete

The verified Layer 0 second residual now passes through the real final norm and output projection:

```text
x2 = Layer-0 second residual
  ↓
output_norm.weight
  ↓
output.weight
  ↓
151936 logits
  ↓
argmax/top-k diagnostic
```

This is a Layer-0-only logits signal. It is not the true final autoregressive Qwen prediction because the remaining transformer blocks have not been implemented.

## Verified GGUF tensors

```text
output_norm.weight  F32   896 × 1
output.weight       Q8_0  896 × 151936
vocab               151936
hidden              896
epsilon             1e-6
```

Both `output.weight` and `token_embd.weight` exist as separate tensors, so the LM head is not assumed to be tied. The implementation uses `mmap` and on-demand Q8_0 row decoding; it does not copy the full output matrix into RAM.

